\[a_{2}^{z_{h}}(u_{h};v_{h},\mathbf{w}_{h})-a_{2}^{z_{h}^{\star}}(u _{h};v_{h},\mathbf{w}_{h})\] (5.32) \[=\sum_{\kappa\,\in\,\mathcal{T}_{h}}\int_{\partial_{-}\kappa(z_{ h},\,-\,z_{h}^{\star})}\mathbf{u}_{h}\cdot\mathbf{n}(v_{hi}^{\text{ext}}-v_{hi}^{ \text{int}})(w_{hi}^{\text{int}}-w_{hi}^{\text{ext}})\,ds\]

where

\[\partial_{-}\kappa(z,\,-\,z^{\star})=\{x\,\in\,\partial\kappa;\,\mathbf{z} \cdot\mathbf{n}(x)<0\quad\text{and}\quad\mathbf{z}^{\star}\cdot\mathbf{n}(x)>0\}.\]

Thus, in view of (5.29) we can replace not only \(v_{h}\) by \(v_{h}-Pv_{h}\) but also \(w_{h}\) by \(w_{h}-Pw_{h}\). This gives:

